      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T23:15:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting; we call this twice.\n\nCould you explain to me again how this works? Does this match the policy -\u003e tmpl -\u003e SA, and update all those in that order? If so, what happens when it fails to find the SA for the second policy (because it was already updated)?\n\n```\npol4 -\u003e tmpl4 -+                      pol4\u0027 -\u003e tmpl4\u0027 -+\n               +-\u003e sa       \u003d\u003d\u003e                        +-\u003e sa\u0027\npol6 -\u003e tmpl6 -+                      pol6 -\u003e tmpl6 --------------\u003e ?\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1936,
        "startChar": 41,
        "endLine": 1936,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "20601a9d4718870e0d7836f64b1d69e9b49cdad2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
